Simply pick and hold regardless of what’s happening to the prices? Or carefully pick and respect price. 

Through a natural process of averaging up on winners in selected themes and trimming out the weeds, the market has helped me concentrate into 3-5 winners (50%~80% weight) in the past two years, while allowing some other smaller positions for rotation/ new ideas and possibly the next winner if they can prove themselves.

